{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0JvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLTIwMTUvQiUyMEElMjBQYXNzJTIwJTI4MjAxMyUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"B A Pass","description":"After losing his parents in a car accident, Mukesh stays at his Aunt's house in Delhi. Enrolled in a good for nothing course in college he finds peace by playing chess at the local cemetery, the rest of the times he worries over ways to make a living and taking care of his sisters. 'B.A.Pass' is a story looking at the fatal promise of a new life. When Mukesh meets Sarika 'auntie' at a kitty party, little does he know of the city and it's ways and means to survive. Sarika seduces Mukesh, shy and inexperienced he falls for her. What follows is a twist of destiny, a kind of story that appears in the tabloids as 'heinous acts of crime'","releaseInfo":"2013","genres":["Drama","Bollywood"],"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/A9GhjUpw3bSJO9OLC1dDBfCgUHa.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dCZb9vMCNBL0eaNPtgexsjAxVVN.jpg","imdbRating":"5.4","runtime":"95 min","cast":["Shadab Kamal","Shilpa Shukla","Dibyendu Bhattacharya","Rajesh Sharma","Deepti Naval","Geeta Agrawal Sharma","Vijay Kaushik","Shikha Joshi"],"director":["Ajay Bahl"],"released":"2012-08-30T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Seduction Corruption Deception","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Shadab Kamal","character":"Mukesh","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8MptMKeeeJk95HJYuQfgd9hVXPO.jpg"},{"name":"Shilpa Shukla","character":"Sarika Khanna","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tSOAtTPNJbIb2Ldp52XgW27exFD.jpg"},{"name":"Dibyendu Bhattacharya","character":"Johnny","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/uLlGKCL9y5CFBwcAafTDQhupz5h.jpg"},{"name":"Rajesh Sharma","character":"Ashok Khanna","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cBmZY1EICMD1q16Fx7GqpHkc6A1.jpg"},{"name":"Deepti Naval","character":"Mrs. Suhasini","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6G0miCgpQcXVJqsY7nt1wPn4evK.jpg"},{"name":"Geeta Agrawal Sharma","ch